# Copy this file to .env and paste your key in, then restart `npm run dev`.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Get a key at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
#
# These are read ONLY by the server-side route in server/knowledgeRoutes.js.
# They deliberately have no VITE_ prefix, so Vite will never inline them into
# the browser bundle. Never rename to VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY — that would ship
# your key to every visitor.
#
# .env is gitignored. Don't commit it.
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Optional. Leave unset to use the default (gpt-4o). Set this if you get a
# "model isn't available to this key" error, or to use a different model.
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o

# Optional. Offline mode: return deterministic sample content and never call
# OpenAI. Useful for building the UI, or for demoing without a key, a network
# connection, or a bill. Every summary it writes is prefixed "[offline sample]"
# so it cannot be mistaken for real output.
# OPENAI_MOCK=1
